    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d254">

                <pb facs="0446" n="314" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg314"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source"> Truman Papers</note>
                <head>No. 254<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Note by the President’s Chief of
                        Staff</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Leahy</hi>)<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d254-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-sibling-dates" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-04">Undated</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Korea</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Recommend a four power agreement that upon the defeat of Japan Korea be placed
                    under a trusteeship composed of China, Great Britain, the Soviet Republic [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">sic</hi>], and the United States for <pb facs="0447"
                        n="315" xml:id="pg315"/> so long a time as is necessary for it to
                    demonstrate, and until it shall have demonstrated, its capacity to govern itself
                    as a free and independent sovereign state.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
